---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Terms · Tracelane"
  description="Terms of service for tracelane.dev and the Tracelane software."
>
  <section class="container-prose py-24">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs text-fg-dim mb-4 tracking-wider lowercase">terms of service</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Terms.</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
      This page covers tracelane.dev — the marketing site. Paid hosted tiers and self-hosted commercial use will have separate detailed terms at V1 launch.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-16 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Software license</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
      The Tracelane core is licensed under
      <a href="https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0" class="underline decoration-fg-subtle hover:decoration-fg transition-colors" rel="noopener">Apache 2.0</a>. The
      <code class="font-mono text-fg">/ee</code>
      directory is covered by the Tracelane Enterprise License (paid-tier features). The
      <code class="font-mono text-fg">/spec</code>
      directory is CC0.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-16 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Site content license</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
      The content on tracelane.dev (text, structure, design) is licensed
      <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" class="underline decoration-fg-subtle hover:decoration-fg transition-colors" rel="noopener">CC-BY-4.0</a>. You may reuse with attribution. Third-party brand names mentioned on this site (Anthropic, OpenAI, Cloudflare, Helicone, LiteLLM, etc.) remain the property of their owners.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-16 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Paid tiers + payment processing</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
      Paid tiers will be processed via
      <a href="https://polar.sh" class="underline decoration-fg-subtle hover:decoration-fg transition-colors" rel="noopener">Polar.sh</a>
      as the merchant of record at V1 launch. Polar.sh handles global tax collection (EU VAT, US sales tax, India GST, ~50 countries). Detailed subscription terms will appear at checkout.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-16 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">No warranty</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
      The software and the site are provided "as is" under the Apache 2.0 license, without warranty of any kind. Nothing on this site constitutes a binding commitment to ship features, dates, or SLAs until contractual terms are signed.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-16 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Contact</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
      Questions about these terms — <code class="font-mono text-fg">support@tracelane.dev</code>.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-16 text-sm text-fg-subtle">Last updated: May 20, 2026.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
